---
/**
 * Variant 12: Cyan - Dark Mode
 * Dark charcoal background with orange accents and warm gray tones
 */
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Variante 12 - Cyan Dark | Mobile Kinderosteopathie Leipzig</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --color-cyan-400: #22d3ee;
      --color-cyan-500: #06b6d4;
      --color-cyan-600: #0891b2;

      --color-stone-300: #d6d3d1;
      --color-stone-400: #a8a29e;
      --color-stone-500: #78716c;
      --color-stone-600: #57534e;
      --color-stone-700: #44403c;
      --color-stone-800: #292524;
      --color-stone-850: #1f1d1c;
      --color-stone-900: #1c1917;
      --color-stone-850: #1f1d1c;
      --color-cyan-dark: #164e63;
      --color-stone-950: #0c0a09;
      --color-cyan-accent: #083344;

      --font-sans: 'DM Sans', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      --font-serif: 'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      color: var(--color-stone-300);
      background: var(--color-stone-950);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 1200px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    /* Header */
    .header {
      padding: 24px 0;
      background: var(--color-stone-950);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-stone-800);
    }

    .header-inner {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .logo span {
      color: var(--color-cyan-500);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .nav a {
      color: var(--color-stone-400);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .nav a:hover {
      color: var(--color-cyan-400);
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--color-cyan-500);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--color-cyan-600);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    .btn-outline {
      border: 2px solid var(--color-stone-600);
      color: var(--color-stone-300);
      background: transparent;
    }

    .btn-outline:hover {
      border-color: var(--color-cyan-500);
      color: var(--color-cyan-400);
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 80px 0;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-stone-950) 0%, var(--color-stone-900) 100%);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -20%;
      width: 60%;
      height: 150%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-content h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 3.5rem;
      font-weight: 400;
      line-height: 1.1;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .hero-content h1 span {
      color: var(--color-cyan-400);
    }

    .hero-content p {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      color: var(--color-stone-400);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .hero-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .hero-visual {
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-image-main {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 4/5;
      border-radius: 24px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-800);
    }

    .hero-image-main img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.95);
    }

    .hero-badge {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -20px;
      left: -20px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cyan-500) 0%, var(--color-cyan-600) 100%);
      color: white;
      padding: 20px 28px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
    }

    .hero-badge-number {
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: block;
    }

    .hero-badge-text {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* Features */
    .features-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
      background: var(--color-stone-900);
    }

    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }

    .section-label {
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--color-cyan-400);
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .section-header p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--color-stone-400);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      background: var(--color-stone-850);
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-800);
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }

    .feature-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      border-color: var(--color-cyan-500);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), 0 0 0 1px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 56px;
      height: 56px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2) 0%, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1) 100%);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      color: var(--color-cyan-400);
    }

    .feature-icon svg {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .feature-card p {
      color: var(--color-stone-400);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* About */
    .about-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
      background: var(--color-stone-950);
      position: relative;
    }

    .about-section::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: -20%;
      width: 50%;
      height: 100%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.05) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .about-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 80px;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
    }

    .about-images {
      position: relative;
    }

    .about-image-1 {
      width: 80%;
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
      border-radius: 20px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      border: 1px solid var(--color-stone-800);
    }

    .about-image-1 img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.9);
    }

    .about-image-2 {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -30px;
      right: 0;
      width: 55%;
      aspect-ratio: 4/3;
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border: 3px solid var(--color-stone-900);
    }

    .about-image-2 img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
      filter: brightness(0.9);
    }

    .about-content h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .about-content p {
      color: var(--color-stone-400);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .credentials-list {
      margin-top: 32px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .credential {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--color-stone-300);
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .credential::before {
      content: "";
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background: var(--color-cyan-500);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.5);
    }

    /* CTA */
    .cta-section {
      padding: 100px 0;
      background: var(--color-stone-900);
    }

    .cta-card {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-cyan-600) 0%, var(--color-cyan-500) 100%);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 80px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .cta-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      right: -30%;
      width: 80%;
      height: 150%;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .cta-card h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-serif);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      color: white;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .cta-card p {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    .btn-dark {
      background: var(--color-stone-900);
      color: white;
    }

    .btn-dark:hover {
      background: var(--color-stone-800);
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer {
      background: var(--color-stone-950);
      color: var(--color-stone-500);
      padding: 64px 0 32px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone-800);
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .footer h4 {
      color: white;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .footer p {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .footer-links {
      list-style: none;
    }

    .footer-links li {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .footer-links a {
      color: var(--color-stone-500);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-links a:hover {
      color: var(--color-cyan-400);
    }

    .footer-bottom {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-stone-800);
      padding-top: 32px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
    }

    /* Back link */
    .back-link {
      position: fixed;
      top: 20px;
      right: 20px;
      background: var(--color-cyan-500);
      color: white;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      z-index: 100;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .back-link:hover {
      background: var(--color-cyan-600);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
      .hero-visual { order: -1; max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 48px; }
      .about-images { max-width: 400px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .nav { display: none; }
      .hero-content h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 32px; }
      .cta-card { padding: 48px 24px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a href="/project/designs" class="back-link">← Alle Varianten</a>

  <!-- Header -->
  <header class="header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <a href="#" class="logo">Susanne<span>.</span>Hoppe</a>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="#">Home</a>
        <a href="#">Über mich</a>
        <a href="#">Leistungen</a>
        <a href="#">Kontakt</a>
      </nav>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Termin anfragen</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-grid">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h1>Mobile Kinderosteopathie <span>bei Ihnen zuhause</span></h1>
          <p>
            Sanfte osteopathische Behandlung für Ihr Kind – in der vertrauten
            Atmosphäre Ihres Zuhauses. Entspannt, individuell und mit über
            20 Jahren Erfahrung.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary">Termin vereinbaren</a>
            <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline">Mehr erfahren</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-visual">
          <div class="hero-image-main">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555252333-9f8e92e65df9?w=600&h=750&fit=crop" alt="Kinderosteopathie" />
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge">
            <span class="hero-badge-number">20+</span>
            <span class="hero-badge-text">Jahre Erfahrung</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="features-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <span class="section-label">Vorteile</span>
        <h2>Warum mobile Behandlung?</h2>
        <p>Ihr Kind profitiert von einer entspannten Behandlung in vertrauter Umgebung.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 12l2-2m0 0l7-7 7 7M5 10v10a1 1 0 001 1h3m10-11l2 2m-2-2v10a1 1 0 01-1 1h-3m-6 0a1 1 0 001-1v-4a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v4a1 1 0 001 1m-6 0h6" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Behandlung zuhause</h3>
          <p>Kein Stress mit Anfahrt und Wartezeiten. Ihr Kind kann in seiner gewohnten Umgebung bleiben.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Sanfte Methoden</h3>
          <p>Osteopathische Techniken speziell für Kinder – behutsam und im Tempo Ihres Kindes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3>20+ Jahre Erfahrung</h3>
          <p>Langjährige Praxiserfahrung als Physiotherapeutin und Osteopathin mit Kindern.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- About -->
  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="about-grid">
        <div class="about-images">
          <div class="about-image-1">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=500&h=650&fit=crop&crop=face" alt="Susanne Hoppe" />
          </div>
          <div class="about-image-2">
            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587654780291-39c9404d746b?w=400&h=300&fit=crop" alt="Behandlung" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-content">
          <span class="section-label">Über mich</span>
          <h2>Susanne Hoppe</h2>
          <p>
            Ich bin Physiotherapeutin und zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin
            mit über 20 Jahren Erfahrung in der Arbeit mit Kindern.
          </p>
          <p>
            Als mobile Osteopathin komme ich zu Ihnen nach Hause – damit Ihr Kind
            in seiner vertrauten Umgebung behandelt werden kann. Entspannt,
            ohne Wartezeiten und ohne stressige Anfahrt.
          </p>

          <div class="credentials-list">
            <div class="credential">Staatlich geprüfte Physiotherapeutin</div>
            <div class="credential">Zertifizierte Kinder-Osteopathin</div>
            <div class="credential">20+ Jahre Berufserfahrung</div>
          </div>

          <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-top: 32px;">Mehr über mich</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-card">
        <h2>Bereit für einen Termin?</h2>
        <p>
          Ich freue mich darauf, Sie und Ihr Kind kennenzulernen.
          Kontaktieren Sie mich für ein unverbindliches Gespräch.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn-dark">Kontakt aufnehmen</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div>
          <h4>Susanne Hoppe</h4>
          <p>
            Mobile Kinderosteopathie in Leipzig.<br>
            Behandlung bei Ihnen zuhause.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Navigation</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Über mich</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Leistungen</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Kontakt</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Rechtliches</h4>
          <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="#">Impressum</a></li>
            <li><a href="#">Datenschutz</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        © 2025 Susanne Hoppe. Alle Rechte vorbehalten.
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
